# Clean GRCh38 ELS source pools by chromosome

This directory contains chromosome-specific enhancer-positive BED files generated
by `src/get_whole_body_regulatory_sets.sh`. The source SCREEN ELS collection is
deduplicated by cCRE ID, and every locus overlapping a unique SVN locus by at
least one base is excluded before chromosome splitting.

| chromosome | complete_SCREEN_ELS | silencer_loci_removed | clean_positive_loci | synthetic_negatives | missing_synthetic_negatives |
|:-----------|--------------------:|-----------------------:|--------------------:|--------------------:|----------------------------:|
| chr1  | 153,196 | 28,920 | 124,276 | 124,218 | 58 |
| chr2  | 144,254 | 14,291 | 129,963 | 129,916 | 47 |
| chr3  | 113,596 | 9,583 | 104,013 | 103,999 | 14 |
| chr4  | 86,232 | 10,835 | 75,397 | 75,374 | 23 |
| chr5  | 97,469 | 10,498 | 86,971 | 86,957 | 14 |
| chr6  | 101,231 | 16,221 | 85,010 | 84,993 | 17 |
| chr7  | 90,955 | 8,265 | 82,690 | 82,635 | 55 |
| chr8  | 83,028 | 7,324 | 75,704 | 75,673 | 31 |
